Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.46,0:23:29.70,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1035.3,1060)\3c&H0037D3&\t(4679,4979,\bord2\blur2)\t(6415,6715,\bord0\blur0)\fad(150,150)}不
